# Embedding Implementation Guide

**Full plan:** `docs/VECTOR_PLAN.md` — read it first.
**Input:** `data/raw/{episode_id}/mood_enriched.json` (from enrichment phase)
**Outputs:** `data/raw/{episode_id}/mood_vector.json` + ChromaDB at `data/chroma/`

---

## File map

```
backend/embedding/
  __init__.py
  episode_vectorizer.py  ← pure math, no ChromaDB import
  chroma_store.py        ← ChromaDB only, no math
  __main__.py            ← CLI
```

No changes to `backend/scraping/` or `backend/enrichment/`. No LangGraph. No database other than ChromaDB.

